            "label": "(i)",
            "source": {
              "qp": 2,
              "ms": 9
            },
            "stem": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Binding of ADH to the ADH receptor triggers reactions within the cell. One of the first reactions is the production of cyclic AMP (cAMP).",
